{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2021-09-13 09:05:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS PRIMESIM RELIABILITY ANALYSIS SOLUTION ACCELERATES DESIGN OF HYPER-CONVERGENT ICS FOR MISSION-CRITICAL APPLICATIONS', 'text': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., SEPT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HIGHLIGHTS FOR THIS ANNOUNCEMENT: UNIFIED WORKFLOW OF PROVEN TECHNOLOGIES PROVIDES HIGH-PERFORMANCE RELIABILITY ANALYSIS ACROSS THE PRODUCT LIFECYCLE COMPLIANT WITH STANDARDS SUCH AS ISO 26262 INTEGRATION WITH PRIMESIM™ CONTINUUM SOLUTION ENABLES SEAMLESS USE OF INDUSTRY-LEADING SIMULATORS FOR ELECTROMIGRATION/IR DROP ANALYSIS, MOS AGING, HIGH-SIGMA MONTE CARLO, ANALOG FAULT AND OTHER RELIABILITY ANALYSES INTEGRATION WITH PRIMEWAVE™ DESIGN ENVIRONMENT PROVIDES A CONSISTENT RELIABILITY VERIFICATION WORKFLOW ENABLING WEAKNESS ANALYSIS, RESULTS VISUALIZATION AND WHAT-IF EXPLORATION TO ACCELERATE TIME-TO-RELIABILITY COMPLIANCE OF HYPER-CONVERGENT DESIGNS TARGETING MISSION-CRITICAL APPLICATIONS, SYNOPSYS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY SHARED THAT SEVERAL LEADING SEMICONDUCTOR COMPANIES HAVE ADOPTED ITS NEW PRIMESIM™ RELIABILITY ANALYSIS SOLUTION THAT UNIFIES PRODUCTION-PROVEN, FOUNDRY-CERTIFIED RELIABILITY ANALYSIS TECHNOLOGIES FOR ANALOG, MIXED-SIGNAL AND FULL-CUSTOM DESIGNS.'}